{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His World is a short, low-poly visual novel about quiet loneliness, small hopes and\u00a0family strain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a shy young boy from a struggling household. He spends his days at a battered computer, with a family that doesn\u2019t understand. Across chapters you will live through awkward days, small victories and humiliating setbacks and a few choices that ripple into one of the different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness his inner world and how his family treats him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A digital layer showing his computer and online life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasional decision moments that determine one of multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay duration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly graphics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content warning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains themes of family conflict, bullying and anxiety; includes verbal taunts and emotional intensity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004680?t=1767944460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004680?t=1767944460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004680/645cb612814dc56b2075e2ce2ef0c215dfc7d55d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767944460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004680/645cb612814dc56b2075e2ce2ef0c215dfc7d55d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767944460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"descripti